    GuiRgba8888CompositorByteStorageFinishError kind category entry

//: gui_rgba8888_compositor_byte_storage_prepare_error_from_lower: lower prepare error を compositor range error へ[写/うつ]す
//:
//: lower kind / category を[読/よ]んでから lower owner を[消費/しょうひ]し、metadata [付/つ]き range owner を[復元/ふくげん]します。
//:
//: neplg2:test[skip]
//: ```neplg2
//:| #import "alloc/gui/render2d/compositor_byte_storage" as *
